# Cross-Platform Handoff

Canonical rule: `rules/dev/cross-platform-handoff.md`.

Before ending a session in a worktree: push commits and run `/switch-dev handoff #N`.

Resume on a new platform: `/switch-dev resume #N` then continue **Next** from the issue Resume block.
